        "hypothesis": "The previous feature engineering attempt (49.4 RMSE) added complex interactions that likely introduced noise; a simpler feature set focusing on the ratio of floor area to heating/cooling degree days and the interaction between building class and energy star rating may capture key physical relationships without overfitting.",
